---
layout: base.njk
title: My Blog
---
<h1>My Blog</h1>

<p>Edit posts at <a href="http://localhost:3001/admin">the admin server</a> (Decap CMS).
Content is stored on disk under <code>content/posts/</code>; Lume regenerates this
site whenever a file changes.</p>

{% set posts = search.pages("url^=/content/posts/", "date=desc") %}

{% if posts.length == 0 %}
  <p><em>No posts yet — add one in the admin UI.</em></p>
{% else %}
  <ul style="list-style:none;padding:0">
  {% for post in posts %}
    <li style="margin-bottom:1rem">
      <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.title or post.src.slug }}</a>
      {% if post.date %}
        <small style="margin-left:0.5rem;color:#666">{{ post.date | date("MMMM d, yyyy") }}</small>
      {% endif %}
    </li>
  {% endfor %}
  </ul>
{% endif %}
